            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uhoraho abarira Mose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ati Barira Abisirayeli bakuzanire amavuta y’umwisengesure avuye muri elayo zisekuwe, ya ya matara, kugira ngo haze hame har’ itara ryaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyuma ya ca gihuzu gikingiriye vya Bishinga intahe, mw ihema ry’ibonaniro, az’ abe ari ho Aroni azokwama aritunganiriza, kugira ngo rize ryame ryaka imbere yanje, rihēre ku mugoroba rishitse mu gitondo ubudasība: iryo rize ribabere ibgirizwa ry’intahava ukw ibihe vy’urunganwe rwanyu bizogenda bikurikirana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.39.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 39:37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aze yame atunganiriza ayo matara kur’ ico gitereko c’izahabu iramuye, kugira ngo yame yakira imbere yanje ubudasiba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
