            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo muhungu w’Umwisirayelikazi arogota kuri rya Zina, ararituka: bamuzanira Mose. Nyina yitwa Shelomiti, mwene Diburi, wo mu muryango wa Dani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
